doing that.<br /> <br /> You can't control what ParaWolf will do; but you <i>can</i> control how you respond to it.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> If it's deserved, it cannot be excessive by definition. <br /> Excessive imply that we're giving them more snark that they deserve. It's one or the other.<br /> <br /> The snark wouldn't be so omnipresent if parawolf wasn't so determined to use the WOD as it's personal toilet.<br /> <br /> <br /> And the experience on the forum for you may be irritating, but it's clear that for many people, it's actually the opposite, a needed catharsis in the face of impending disaster.<br /> <br /> And on that matter, you can't control what we do on the forum, but you can choose to not react to it.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24043-nyremne","name":"Nyremne","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-20T14:56:41-07:00","id":1521073,"title":"","content":"You're not giving <i>them any </i>snark; they don't read these forums. The snark is excessive because it's making it unpleasant for many who <i>do </i>read these forums.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-20T15:00:20-07:00","id":1521074,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1520848-possibly-m5?p=1521073#post1521073\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You're not giving <i>them any </i>snark; they don't read these forums. The snark is excessive because it's making it unpleasant for many who <i>do </i>read these forums.</div> </div> </div> </div>Now I'm afraid you're getting irrational, you don't need someone to hear or read you to be snarky on them. Hell, you don't even need someone to be a real person to make snarky remarks on them.<br /> <br /> And the snark may be unpleasant to some, and cathartic to others. This is a forum, you can't police what people say because you might feel unconfortable.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24043-nyremne","name":"Nyremne","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank"